"Mobile navigation\" hidden><div class=\"mobile-platform-links\" aria-label=\"Lukan platforms\"><a href=\"https://cloud.lukan.ai\">Cloud</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">|</span><a href=\"https://knowledge.lukan.ai\">Knowledge</a></div><a href=\"#products\">Products</a><a href=\"#services\">Solutions</a><a href=\"#services\">Services</a><a href=\"#industries\">Industries</a><a href=\"#infrastructure\">Infrastructure</a><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></nav></header><main><section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\"><img class=\"hero-image\" src=\"/media/hero-infrastructure-v2.png\" alt=\"Abstract private AI infrastructure\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" fetchpriority=\"high\" data-hero-image><div class=\"hero-shade\"></div><div class=\"hero-inner\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Private AI systems</p><h1>AI that lives<br>where you work.</h1><p class=\"hero-copy\">Proprietary products and custom engineering for private AI systems connected to your data and ready to operate.</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"button button-light\" href=\"#products\">Explore products</a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#services\">View services <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2198</span></a></div></div><p class=\"hero-caption\">Lukan AI \u00b7 Madrid / Remote</p></section><section class=\"technology-band\" aria-labelledby=\"technology-title\"><div class=\"technology-inner\"><div class=\"technology-copy\" data-reveal><p class=\"section-index\">Technology ecosystem</p><h2 id=\"technology-title\">Local and proprietary frontier models.</h2><p>Run open models on private infrastructure or connect leading proprietary models and cloud platforms through one production architecture.</p></div><ul class=\"technology-logos\" aria-label=\"Compatible technologies and model providers\" data-reveal><li class=\"logo-wide\"><img src=\"/technologies/vllm.svg\" alt=\"vLLM\" loading=\"lazy\"></li><li><img src=\"/technologies/nvidia.svg\" alt=\"NVIDIA\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>NVIDIA</span></li><li><img src=\"/technologies/azure.svg\" alt=\"Microsoft Azure\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Azure</span></li><li><img src=\"/technologies/google-cloud.svg\" alt=\"Google Cloud\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Google Cloud</span></li><li class=\"logo-wide\"><img src=\"/technologies/aws.svg\" alt=\"Amazon Web Services\" loading=\"lazy\"></li><li><img src=\"/technologies/openai.svg\" alt=\"OpenAI\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>OpenAI</span></li><li><img src=\"/technologies/gemini.svg\" alt=\"Google Gemini\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Gemini</span></li><li><img src=\"/technologies/claude.svg\" alt=\"Anthropic Claude\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Claude</span></li><li class=\"logo-wide\"><img src=\"/technologies/cloudflare.svg\" alt=\"Cloudflare\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ul><p class=\"technology-note\">Technology marks indicate supported ecosystems and do not imply endorsement or partnership.</p></div></section><section class=\"intro\" id=\"products\"><div class=\"intro-inner\" data-reveal><p class=\"section-index\">01 \u2014 Products</p><h2>One private foundation for applied AI.</h2><p>Cloud connects private environments. Desktop brings the agent into daily work. Knowledge turns organizational information into useful context.</p></div></section><section class=\"product product-dark\" id=\"cloud\"><div class=\"product-inner\"><div class=\"product-copy\" data-reveal><div><p class=\"product-label\">Lukan Cloud</p><h3>Your local environment, available when you need it.</h3></div><div class=\"product-detail\"><p>Access your local environment remotely and expose ports in a controlled way, while keeping execution close to your own infrastructure.</p><ul><li>Remote access</li><li>Controlled port exposure</li><li>Model connectivity</li></ul></div></div><figure class=\"product-visual wide-visual\" data-reveal><img src=\"/media/lukan-cloud-access.png\" alt=\"A controlled connection between private compute environments\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></section><section class=\"desktop-product\" id=\"desktop\"><div class=\"desktop-product-inner\"><div class=\"desktop-product-copy\" data-reveal><p class=\"product-label\">Lukan Desktop</p><h3>An AI workspace on your own machine.</h3><p class=\"desktop-product-description\">A productivity and coding agent that works close to your projects, with secure remote access through Lukan Cloud.</p><div class=\"desktop-download\"><a class=\"button button-light\" href=\"https://get.lukan.ai/desktop/windows/x64/latest/lukan-desktop-x64-setup.exe\" aria-label=\"Download Lukan Desktop for Windows x64\">Download for Windows <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2193</span></a><p class=\"desktop-download-meta\">Windows 10/11 \u00b7 x64</p></div></div><figure class=\"desktop-product-visual\" data-reveal><img src=\"/media/lukan-desktop.png\" alt=\"Lukan Desktop workspace with an AI coding agent and remote Cloud access\" width=\"1919\" height=\"1021\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></section><section class=\"product product-dark\" id=\"knowledge\"><div class=\"product-inner\"><div class=\"product-copy\" data-reveal><div><p class=\"product-label\">Lukan Knowledge</p><h3>Private knowledge that answers with context.</h3></div><div class=\"product-detail\"><p>RAG for private documentation, built to retrieve relevant evidence and produce grounded answers.</p><ul><li>Document ingestion</li><li>Retrieval and reranking</li><li>Answers with sources</li></ul></div></div><figure class=\"product-visual wide-visual\" data-reveal><img src=\"/media/knowledge-documents.png\" alt=\"Documents becoming structured layers of private knowledge\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></section><section class=\"infrastructure\" id=\"infrastructure\"><img src=\"/media/local-inference.png\" alt=\"Compact infrastructure for local AI inference\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"infrastructure-overlay\"></div><div class=\"infrastructure-copy\" data-reveal><p class=\"eyebrow\">Local infrastructure</p><h2>Models closer to the data.</h2><p>We design and deploy local inference infrastructure for greater control, lower dependency and an architecture shaped around each workload.</p></div></section><section class=\"services\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"services-heading\" data-reveal><p class=\"section-index\">02 \u2014 Core building blocks</p><h2>From complex inputs to operational AI.</h2><p>Modular systems for understanding documents, grounding knowledge and connecting AI to real workflows.</p></div><div class=\"service-list\"><article data-reveal><span>01</span><h3>Agentic Document Extraction</h3><p>Parse complex layouts, tables and mixed document formats into structured, traceable data.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>02</span><h3>Agentic RAG</h3><p>Retrieve the right evidence and build grounded answers over private organizational knowledge.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>03</span><h3>AI Automations</h3><p>Purpose-built workflows connected to your applications, data and controls.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>04</span><h3>Local Inference</h3><p>Architecture, deployment and operation of models on private infrastructure.</p></article><article id=\"document-apis\" data-reveal><span>05</span><h3>Structured Extraction API</h3><p>Describe the fields your workflow needs and receive consistent, machine-ready data from complex documents.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>06</span><h3>Document Parsing API</h3><p>Transform PDFs, scans and office documents into clean Markdown ready for search, RAG and downstream automation.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>07</span><h3>Custom AI Design &amp; Development</h3><p>End-to-end product design and engineering, from architecture and user experience to implementation, deployment and ongoing support.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"industries\" id=\"industries\"><div class=\"industries-inner\"><div class=\"industries-heading\" data-reveal><p class=\"section-index\">03 \u2014 Industries</p><h2>Applied AI for document-heavy operations.</h2><p>Systems designed around private data, domain constraints and the way each organization already works.</p></div><div class=\"industry-list\"><article data-reveal><span>01</span><h3>Financial Services</h3><p>Research, onboarding, reporting and compliance workflows.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>02</span><h3>Healthcare</h3><p>Private knowledge and controlled document processing.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>03</span><h3>Insurance</h3><p>Claims, policies and structured extraction at scale.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>04</span><h3>Energy &amp; Utilities</h3><p>Technical documentation and operational knowledge.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>05</span><h3>Legal</h3><p>Document review, research and evidence-grounded answers.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>06</span><h3>Logistics</h3><p>Operational documents and connected AI workflows.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"principle\"><div data-reveal><p class=\"section-index\">Our principle</p><blockquote>AI creates value when it fits the operation, respects the data and keeps working after the demo.</blockquote></div></section><section class=\"contact\" id=\"contact\"><div class=\"contact-inner\" data-reveal><p class=\"eyebrow\">Let\u2019s talk</p><h2>Build the system your operation actually needs.</h2><a class=\"button button-light\" href=\"mailto:hello@lukan.ai\">hello@lukan.ai <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></a></div></section></main><footer class=\"footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"Lukan home\"><img src=\"/brand/lukan-wordmark.png\" alt=\"Lukan\" width=\"96\" height=\"28\"></a><p>Private AI systems for real operations.</p><nav aria-label=\"Footer navigation\"><a href=\"#products\">Products</a><a href=\"#services\">Services</a><a href=\"#industries\">Industries</a><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></nav></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>\u00a9 2026 Lukan AI</span><